## Third-party components

This project installs and calls the following independently licensed projects.
They are not vendored here; each retains its own license.

| Project | License | Role |
|---|---|---|
| [Kronos](https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos) | MIT | Time-series foundation model (research desk) |
| [skfolio](https://github.com/skfolio/skfolio) | BSD-3-Clause | Black-Litterman + CVaR optimization (portfolio desk) |
| [NautilusTrader](https://github.com/nautechsystems/nautilus_trader) | LGPL-3.0 | Order domain objects (execution desk) |

NautilusTrader is LGPL-3.0. This project imports it as a library without
modification and does not distribute it. If you redistribute a modified
NautilusTrader, the LGPL-3.0 terms apply to those modifications.

