## Not financial advice

This software is a paper-trading research tool. It does not connect to any
broker, and `EXECUTION_MODE` is fixed to `"paper"` with a runtime guard that
refuses to start otherwise. Orders exist only as in-memory domain objects.

Nothing produced by this software — model views, confidence scores, portfolio
weights, or LLM commentary — is investment advice. The forecasting model's
predictive power is unvalidated; an independent evaluation found it
indistinguishable from a random walk. Backtest results shown here or generated
by this software assume no slippage and carry survivorship bias, and therefore
overstate achievable performance.

Use at your own risk. The authors accept no liability for financial loss.
